# E2E (Playwright)

Full guide: `tests/e2e/CONVENTIONS.md`.

## Timeouts

Import from `tests/e2e/helpers/timeouts.ts`:

- `E2E_RECALC_TIMEOUT_MS` — portfolio recalc (`waitForRecalculation`)
- `E2E_PENDING_ACTION_POLL_MS` — pending actions, coupon rows
- `E2E_IMPORT_JOB_TIMEOUT_MS` — file import jobs
- `E2E_HEAVY_DESCRIBE_TIMEOUT_MS` / `E2E_INVESTMENT_DESCRIBE_TIMEOUT_MS` — describe blocks

Do not use 5s defaults for Kafka/import/recalc; use `expect.poll` or shared wait helpers.

## Helpers (reuse, do not duplicate)

| Need | Module |
|------|--------|
| Recalc wait, grid session clear, replay idempotency | `investment-e2e.ts` |
| Coupon day, ISO dates | `fixed-income-e2e.ts` |
| Transaction query scope | `finance-transactions-e2e.ts` |

```typescript
// ❌ getTransactions(accountId, token, { first: 50 })
// ✅ import month matching fixture
import { importFixtureTransactionQuery, nfceTxQuery } from '../helpers/finance-transactions-e2e';
await getTransactions(accountId, token, importFixtureTransactionQuery());
```

