## Idempotency / TWR stress

```typescript
await replayRecalculationRound(token, brokerId, cryptoId);
const first = await getInvestmentPortfolioSummary(token, { period: PerformancePeriod.All });
await replayRecalculationRound(token, brokerId, cryptoId);
const second = await getInvestmentPortfolioSummary(token, { period: PerformancePeriod.All });
expectNear(second.totalCostBasis, first.totalCostBasis, 6);
```

Compare two **post-replay** snapshots, not pre-replay vs post-replay TWR.

## Forms & numbers

- Assert `account-form-submit` disabled instead of accidental submit via blur.
- Use `toBeCloseTo` for balances and TWR from API.
